      "Language": "jpn",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Otsukadai Pharmacy compounded morphine chloride for injection in 32 cancer patients. In 22 cases we compounded morphine into a TPN bag. However we recommend using an infusion pump to control the patient's pain at home. We think that we need a system with a pharmacy for cancer patients before they leave the hospital for home care."},
